  "release_notes": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jamixm4-crypto/natbypass/compare/v1.9.226-beta13...v1.9.226-beta14\n\n- Fix GUI Peer Invisibility: Fixed missing HMAC NetworkKey in NatBypass-GUI signaling channels causing incoming beacons from daemons to fail JSON unmarshaling\n- Multi-Broker Parallel Fan-Out in GUI: NatBypass-GUI now subscribes and broadcasts across primary and backup MQTT brokers (HiveMQ, Mosquitto, EMQX) in parallel\n- Asynchronous GeoIP Flag Resolution: Eliminated synchronous 2s blocking HTTP request in GUI signaling ingestion pipeline\n- Relaxed Signaling Anti-Replay Skew Window: Extended VerifyFrame maxSkew tolerance from 30s to 300s to prevent packet drops due to router/PC clock drift\n- Tunnel Data MQTT Relay Fallback in GUI: Added relay fallback transmission for TUN data when Direct P2P and Direct TCP are unreachable\n- Android Mobile Bridge: Propagated NetworkKey to global signaling fallback manager on initialization and profile change",
